{"overview":"کوسی آرِما، پیانیست نابغه‌ای بود تا زمانی که مرگ ناگهانی مادرش توانایی او برای نواختن را از بین برد. هر روز برای کوسی خسته‌کننده بود. اما او با ویولن‌زن به نام کاوری میازونو آشنا می‌شود که سبک نواختن منحصر به فردی دارد. آیا صداهای دل‌نشین ویولن دختر می‌تواند او را به نواختن دوباره پیانو هدایت کند؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"Kousei Arima was a genius pianist until his mother's sudden death took away his ability to play. Each day was dull for Kousei. But, then he meets a violinist named Kaori Miyazono who has an eccentric playing style. Can the heartfelt sounds of the girl's violin lead the boy to play the piano again?","tagline_en":"I met the girl under full-bloomed cherry blossoms, and my fate has begun to change.","runtime":23,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":2015,"poster":"/1dvtHeNgZ0o4RMTsBIfeiUJXZkQ.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":22,"y":2014,"poster":"/xF6WaSwPhKptpfQb5c9PwTjBXdk.jpg"}],"episodes":22,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"花江夏樹","role":"Kousei Arima (voice)","photo":"/alTb0DlcPIbcwM08WSmxFai58sd.jpg","en":"Natsuki Hanae"},{"name":"ریسا تاندا","role":"Kaori Miyazono (voice)","photo":"/cuUqpOqZyzfJLzRa6syhOLUCvNW.jpg","en":"Risa Taneda"},{"name":"佐倉綾音","role":"Tsubaki Sawabe (voice)","photo":"/yPbTmntASE9psPIMhNGU5oo6vIH.jpg","en":"Ayane Sakura"},{"name":"逢坂良太","role":"Ryouta Watari (voice)","photo":"/d2TGy8Qkxe90tGDr9MCXFGkhbPl.jpg","en":"Ryota Osaka"}],"trailer":"aMJpI_fEsA4","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61663/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"},{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"}]},"GB":{"link":